# M6 mode 1 (co-op) with two virtual controllers: the join screen from
# the main menu, one shared level instance, turns from both players in
# arrival order, shared undo, global pause owned by its opener, a level
# entered by one player and solved by both, hot-plug: a third controller
# joins, is unplugged and its seat is taken over by a new controller.
size 854x480
# The first launch plays the intro: hold a key to skip it.
wait 150
hold enter 70
idle 400
expect state play baba/0level
idle
solve
idle 900
expect state play baba/106level (map)
# Pause → Return to menu → title → Multiplayer.
key escape
key down 3
key enter
idle
expect state title
key down 4
key enter
expect state join Coop players=0
pads 2
pad 1 a
pad 2 a
expect state join Coop players=2
shot 01-join-2
pad 1 a
pad 2 a
expect state ready=2
wait 50
expect state multi Coop players=2 views=1
expect log session Coop baba slot 0 players p1,p2
idle
shot 02-coop-map
# Both players move the one map cursor; P2 confirms 1level.
p1 walk 1level
p2 press wait
idle
expect state v0 p1,p2 slot0 baba/1level
p1 expect level baba/1level
expect same p1 p2
# 1level = ULLLLLLLUUURRDDRRRR: P1 and P2 take turns; P2 undoes P1's
# wrong step (shared undo).
p1 moves ULLL
p2 moves LLLL
p1 moves D
p2 press undo
expect log turn p2 Undo
p1 moves UUUR
p2 moves RDDRRRR
idle 900
expect log p2 win 1level
expect state baba/106level (map)
expect save 0 baba 1level 3
expect save 0 baba_prize total 2
# Global pause: P2 opens it; P1's inputs are ignored; P2 resumes.
p2 press pause
expect state menu=Pause
p1 press back
expect state menu=Pause
shot 03-coop-pause
p2 press back
expect state views=1 | v0 p1,p2
# Hot-plug: a third controller joins mid-session.
pads 1
pad 3 a
expect log join p3 controller
expect state players=3
p3 press left
expect log turn p3 Move
unplug 3
expect log unplugged p3
shot 04-coop-unplugged
pads 1
pad 4 a
expect log rejoin p3 controller
p3 press right
# End the session (host P1): Resume, Restart, Leave game, End session.
p1 press pause
p1 press down 3
p1 press wait
idle
expect state title
expect log end session p1
quit
